    "rm": "Ti has dapli che 5 albums ED las tias datotecas occupeschan {formatGB(usedGB)} plazza (limita: {FREE_TIER_STORAGE_LIMIT_GB} GB). Quests albums vegnan stizzads automaticamain sche ti na decidast betg da stizzar auters albums:",
    "rmy": "Tu sas but maj katar 5 albumura thaj tere fajlura len {formatGB(usedGB)} than (had: {FREE_TIER_STORAGE_LIMIT_GB} GB). Kado albumura tradel pe avtomatik kana tu nai hoxanes te tradel aver albumura:",
